  <h2>Notice and repair the future system</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="micro-drill" data-spot-error data-answer="will" data-hint="Choose one future system; the prior decision calls for be going to here." data-fix="We’re going to rent a backup projector." data-why="Do not combine will with going to in one future verb phrase." data-success-message="Correct. We’re going to rent keeps one complete prior-intention system.">
