    <h3>Repair 2: remove duplicated <span class="ex">will</span></h3><p>Tap the future marker that does not belong in the ordinary time clause.</p><div class="spot-options"><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="call">I’ll call the vendor</button><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="when">when I</button><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="will">will</button><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="arrive">arrive.</button></div><p class="hidden-answer" data-error-feedback></p>
