      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="The cable just broke. I’ll replace it now." data-hint="The second sentence responds immediately to the new problem." data-fix="The cable just broke. I’ll replace it now."><p class="quiz-question">1. Which pair presents an immediate response?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="The cable just broke. I’ll replace it now.">The cable just broke. I’ll replace it now.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="The team approved it yesterday. I’ll have approved it.">The team approved it yesterday. I’ll have approved it.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="The train schedule is official. I’m going to own it.">The train schedule is official. I’m going to own it.</button></div></div>
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="The team approved the rental yesterday. We’re going to rent a backup." data-hint="The earlier approval establishes the prior intention." data-fix="The team approved the rental yesterday. We’re going to rent a backup."><p class="quiz-question">2. Which pair presents a prior intention?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="The team approved the rental yesterday. We’re going to rent a backup.">The team approved the rental yesterday. We’re going to rent a backup.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="The cable just broke. We rent one every Tuesday.">The cable just broke. We rent one every Tuesday.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="The vendor arrived yesterday. We’re meeting now tomorrow.">The vendor arrived yesterday. We’re meeting now tomorrow.</button></div></div>
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="The stand is leaning farther now. It’s going to fall." data-hint="The first sentence supplies the present trajectory foregrounded by going to." data-fix="The stand is leaning farther now. It’s going to fall."><p class="quiz-question">3. Which pair presents a forecast grounded in a visible trajectory?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="The stand is leaning farther now. It’s going to fall.">The stand is leaning farther now. It’s going to fall.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="The stand fell yesterday. It’s meeting a vendor.">The stand fell yesterday. It’s meeting a vendor.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="The stand is stable. It promised to fall.">The stand is stable. It promised to fall.</button></div></div>
